 directed path.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"task_id\": \"t_049448d4\",\n  \"decision\": \"absent\",\n  \"mechanism\": \"cascade\",\n  \"entities\": [1885, 1460],\n  \"window\": [3683, 42083],\n  \"confidence\": 0.76,\n  \"evidence\": [\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_04\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_06\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_08\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_05\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_07\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_02\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_01\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_03\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"}\n  ],\n  \"narrative\": \"1885's out-cone is a thin chain 1885->1572->826->{676,1485,1580}; 1460's in-cone within 2 hops covers 20 nodes, none overlapping that chain. With no directed connection even ignoring time, no chain of interactions with <=600-unit gaps can carry influence from 1885 to 1460 in [3683,42083]. High global event volume and hub activity elsewhere in the graph do not create such a path.\"\n}\n```", "total_input_tokens": 25379, "total_output_tokens": 3182, "total_tokens": 28561, "total_latency_ms": 46607, "llm_calls": 5, "schema_repairs": 0, "status": "success", "error": ""}